# Ponytail Review

Review for unnecessary complexity only. Goal: shorter diff.

Format — one line per finding:
`L<line>: <tag> <what>. <replacement>.`

Tags:
- `delete:` dead code, unused flexibility — replacement: nothing
- `stdlib:` hand-rolled stdlib — name the function
- `native:` dependency for platform feature — name the feature
- `yagni:` abstraction with one impl — inline until second exists
- `shrink:` same logic, fewer lines — show shorter form

Do not nitpick style. Do not suggest rewrites that add lines.
